<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Lioness</h1></div><h2 class="c">HIM</h2><p>I think about him.<br>    I dream about him.<br>    I even write about him.<br>    In my mind,<br>    The light is dim, <br>    And I see <br>    No one but him.<br>    I have a small problem.<br>    Because it seems<br>    That my dreams<br>    Will probably be ripped <br>    Up at the seams.<br>    Even though my thoughts were caught,<br>    I cowered away <br>    While my shallow confidence fought.<br>    &nbsp;Tell him the truth!&nbsp;, it said,<br>    &nbsp;He won't bite!&nbsp;<br>    But I looked in his eyes,<br>    And it just didn't feel right.<br>    So, now I'm forced <br>    To secrecy once again.<br>    And it drives me to<br>    Think, dream, and write about him.<br>    Hopefully, one day soon, <br>    My confidence will have <br>    A victorious win.<br></p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
